        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Events: Federated Auto Parts 400, spring Richmond race\n- Places: Richmond Raceway, Richmond, Virginia, Middle Georgia Raceway\n- Companies: Federated Auto Parts, TMS\n- Topics: stock car racing sponsorship\n\nFacts:\n- Between 1966 and 1971, nine races in this event lineage were held at Middle Georgia Raceway.\n- From 2007 to 2011, the first of Richmond Raceway's two spring races was sponsored by a brand owned by TMS.\n- Federated Auto Parts 400 is an annual stock car race held at Richmond Raceway in Richmond, Virginia.\n- Federated Auto Parts 400 is the second of two races held at Richmond Raceway in the spring.",
